# Host-dev env overrides point *_SERVICE_URL at localhost:* — they must NOT
# leak into the image build, or Next.js bakes localhost into the /svc/* rewrite
# destinations and every rewrite-proxied service 500s (ECONNREFUSED) in-container.
# Root-level patterns above don't match nested paths; these do.
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/.next
apps/web/.turbo
apps/portal/node_modules
brand_guidelines/
docs/
licenses/
*.md
!README.md
